	(text "Four rail supply, 8 to 36 V in: +5V synchronous buck (LTC3891), +3V3 voltage\nmode buck from +5V (TPS54317), +12V synchronous boost from +5V (TPS43061) and a\n+1V8A low noise LDO from +3V3 (LP5912-1.8).\n\nEvery value marked Basis = model is the one the simulation in simulation/smps uses,\nand scripts/kicad/check_netlist.py fails CI if the two disagree. Values marked\ndatasheet are sized from the controller data sheet and are not simulated.\n\nNothing on these sheets has been built or measured."
